                <pb facs="0816" n="700" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg700"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/15181.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brazilian Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-09T23:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 9, 1915—11 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>621. My 617. This afternoon Convention deposed General González Garza and to
                    replace him has elected its President, Lagos Cházaro, Villista delegate from the
                    State of Chihuahua, who was placed in charge of the executive power.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cardoso de Oliveira.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
